name Ancient Greek (Klatt)
// as grc, spoken by eSpeak's Klatt synthesiser with its fourth voice source (the reader's
// option "Klatt voice"); it needs patches/klatt-frame-loudness.patch for the trill and the stops
language grc
// a wider pitch range than the default (82 118), for the pitch accent
pitch 78 150
words 1
klatt 4
